    "preamble": "Gurial Singh vs State Of U.P. And Another on 30 May, 2020 Author: Siddharth Bench: Siddharth High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? In Chamber Case :- Criminal Misc Anticipatory Bail Application U/S 438 Cr.P.C. No. - 2675 of 2020 Applicant :- Gurial Singh Opposite Party :- State of U.P. and Another Counsel for Applicant :- Atul Kumar Counsel for Opposite Party :- G.A. Hon'ble Siddharth,J.",
